      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe School House, Cleariestown, Co. Wexford.\n\nA Charming 4-Bed Detached Residence with Excellent Potential.\n\nThe School House is a charming detached residence set in the highly regarded location of Cleariestown, Co. Wexford. Originally serving as the local school house, this property offers a wonderful opportunity to create a spacious and characterful family home in a peaceful yet well-connected setting.\n\nThe accommodation currently comprises four bedrooms, along with generous living and ancillary spaces. While the property would benefit from modernisation and refurbishment, it retains considerable charm and offers plenty of scope for the new owners to put their own stamp on the home.\n\nSituated in a desirable rural location, The School House enjoys the best of both worlds — a tranquil countryside setting while remaining within easy reach of Wexford Town and the surrounding villages and amenities. The property also provides an excellent base for enjoying the many beaches, coastal walks and attractions that the south-east has to offer.\n\nWith its detached layout, generous accommodation and attractive location,The School House represents an exciting opportunity for those seeking a home with character and potential**. Whether looking to create a comfortable family residence, a characterful country retreat or a property to modernise and enhance over time, this is a property well worth viewing.\n\nKey Features:\n\n* Charming former school house\n* Detached 4-bedroom residence\n* Generous accommodation\n* In need of modernisation\n* Excellent potential to create a wonderful family home\n* Peaceful and attractive location\n* Convenient access to Wexford Town and local amenities\n* Close to the beautiful Wexford coastline and beaches\n\nVirtual tour avaialble on request. \n\nViewing by appoinment with Auctioneer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.53m x 1.31m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.17m x 3.68m\nFireplace, Timber floors.\n\nBedroom (ground floor) - 5.53m x 3.35m\nFeature solid fuel stove, Timber floors, Door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.8m x 1.49m\nw.c. w.h.b. shower.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.36m x 4m\nFitted Kitchen\n\nUtility Room - \nDoor to garden.\n\nShower Room - \nNeeds refurbishment.\n\n1st Floor Landing - \n\n\nBathroom - 2.55m x 2.29m\nw.c. w.h.b. shower.\n\nBedroom - 3.7m x 3.07m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.69m x 3.57m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.71m x 2.37m\n\n\nOffice - 2.67m x 2.56m\n\n\nOutside - \nGardens, Parking, Stone Outbuilding.\n\n"
